flowchart LR
  Public[Public User] --> Forecast[View seven day forecast]
  Public --> Suitability[Request evidence gated crop assessment]
  Public --> Dates[Explore crops by date range]
  Public --> Periods[View candidate periods by crop]
  Registered[Registered User] --> Public
  Registered --> Save[Save recommendation]
  Registered --> History[Review own history and detail]
  Officer[Agricultural Officer] --> Public
  Officer --> Review[Review recommendation evidence]
  Officer --> Validate[Record status and optional comment]
  Admin[Administrator] --> Public
  Admin --> Crops[Manage six approved crop profiles and requirements]
  Admin --> Config[Manage soil compatibility, weights and thresholds]
  Admin --> Roles[Manage users and roles]
  Admin --> Records[View recommendation and validation records]
  flag[Officer validation and history require enabled development features]
  flag -.-> Validate
  flag -.-> History
